wa.me/5511952134536?text=Oi%2C%20tudo%20bem%3F%20Vi%20a%20Squad%20no%20site%20e%20queria%20entender%20como%20os%20agentes%20podem%20ajudar%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hire Maky<span class="_arrow_c0i59_69" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="_visual_qr3s2_41"><div class="_card_qr3s2_46"><img src="/assets/maky-dashboard-en-Cw2AMHUq.png" alt="Painel de Mídia Paga do Squad conduzido pela Maky" class="_dashboard_qr3s2_58"/><img src="/assets/maky-dashboard-mobile-en-CfYq5dIJ.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_dashboardMobile_qr3s2_74"/></div><span class="_characterShadow_qr3s2_89" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="/assets/maky-character-pgomQufS.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_character_qr3s2_89"/></div></section><section class="_section_11aut_1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><ul class="_grid_11aut_7"><li class="_card_11aut_14"><img src="/assets/maky-hl-1-en-BYwLLQxN.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_11aut_71"/><p class="_caption_11aut_78">Monitors and analyzes the competition daily.</p></li><li class="_card_11aut_14"><img src="/assets/maky-hl-2-en-Bdcc_Hoq.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_11aut_71"/><p class="_caption_11aut_78">Creates posts with the context your brand already carries.</p></li><li class="_card_11aut_14"><img src="/assets/maky-hl-3-en-n8KuU0Bb.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_11aut_71"/><p class="_caption_11aut_78">Analyzes, schedules, and posts at the right time.</p></li><li class="_card_11aut_14"><img src="/assets/maky-hl-4-en-CD4o9_ko.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_illus_11aut_71"/><p class="_caption_11aut_78">Engages and keeps up with your network 24/7</p></li></ul></section><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><section class="_section_11a56_1 "><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39">COMPETITOR MONITOR</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Always watching,
always posting</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Maky follows your competitors’ profiles every day, compares their performance with yours, and shows the posts that performed best in your segment. When something works, it drafts your own version in one click.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 ">Learn more<span class="_arrow_11a56_105" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/maky-sec3-en-Bm7p5zj8.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 _reverse_11a56_25"><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39">COMMENTS</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Every comment becomes a
conversation, instantly</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Anyone who comments on your post gets an automatic DM, moving from the storefront to the conversation where the sale happens. It works even with hundreds of comments a day.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 ">Learn more<span class="_arrow_11a56_105" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/maky-sec4-en-BKJSqVJq.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 "><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39">CAMPAIGNS</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">A feed that’s always active,
posted at the right time</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Maky creates and schedules your Instagram posts, single image or carousel, based on what it already knows about your brand. You just review before it goes live.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 ">Learn more<span class="_arrow_11a56_105" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/maky-sec5-en-DJYXtDaF.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 _reverse_11a56_25"><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39">BLOG &amp; AI</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">Show up in
ChatGPT’s answers</h2><p class="_paragraph_11a56_61">Maky writes content to build your brand’s presence in the answers from ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini. The earlier you show up, the greater the chance of becoming the default answer in your segment.</p><button type="button" class="_cta_11a56_69 ">Learn more<span class="_arrow_11a56_105" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 9h11M10 4.5L14.5 9 10 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="_visual_11a56_126"><img src="/assets/maky-sec6-en-DUj5GyA7.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="_image_11a56_133"/></div></section></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="_divider_11a56_12" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="_section_11a56_1 "><div class="_text_11a56_30"><p class="_eyebrow_11a56_39">PAID MEDIA</p><h2 class="_title_11a56_51">More sales on Google,
