quently<br/>asked questions</h2><div class="_list_1sih9_21"><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 _questionOpen_1sih9_55" aria-expanded="true"><span>How does Maky know what to post about my brand?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 _chevronOpen_1sih9_69" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 _answerOpen_1sih9_80"><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Maky learns from what you already have: your website, your social media, the posts that already performed well on your profile, and your brand information registered in Squad. The more context it gets, the more the content it creates sounds like something you’d write yourself.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>Does Maky post on its own or do I approve first?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">You’re in control. Maky creates and schedules everything, but campaigns and posts only go live after your approval. You review before anything is published.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>Does Maky work for any type of business?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Yes. Because it relies on your brand’s context (website, social media, and your profile’s history), Maky adapts to your segment and creates content relevant to your audience, whatever the type of business.</p></div></div><div class="_item_1sih9_29"><button type="button" class="_question_1sih9_35 " aria-expanded="false"><span>Does Maky replace a marketing agency?</span><svg class="_chevron_1sih9_59 " width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="_answerWrap_1sih9_74 "><p class="_answer_1sih9_74">Maky takes over the day-to-day operational work (creating, scheduling, posting, and replying), running 24 hours a day. It handles recurring marketing without you needing an agency or having to learn the platform.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="_footer_1un9y_1"><div class="_card_1un9y_34"><div class="_columns_1un9y_49"><nav class="_column_1un9y_49" aria-label="Support"><p class="_columnTitle_1un9y_61">Support</p><ul class="_linkList_1un9y_69"><li><a href="/terms/index.html" class="_link_1un9y_69">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/index.html" class="_link_1un9y_69">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="https://wa.me/5511952134536?text=Oi%2C%20tudo%20bem%3F%20Vi%20a%20Squad%20no%20site%20e%20queria%20entender%20como%20os%20agentes%20podem%20ajudar%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><nav class="_column_1un9y_49" aria-label="Social"><p class="_columnTitle_1un9y_61">Social</p><ul class="_linkList_1un9y_69"><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/squadcom_br/" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li><li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@squadcom_br?_r=1&amp;_t=ZS-97q74pQJjLF" class="_link_1un9y_69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tiktok</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company